{"3735690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mags and Body Bags", "steam_appid": 3735690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mags and Body Bags is a new, free-to-play, low-poly FPS, PVP shooter and the brain child of a 63 year old idiot who thought what would happen if someone who didn't know or care about the rules of making video games, actually made a video game. Mags and Body Bags is the result of that idiot trying to make a game........actually I didn't make it, I pay other talented people to make it. The game turned into a long-term family project, including help from my children, their spouses and my grand kids. So we have input from family members, young &amp; old.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mags and Body Bags has multiple launch maps, with squads, proximity chat, season pass, no pay to win, key rebinding, steam achievements, multiple modes, rag doll animations, 10 launch maps, customizable body bags (as a player banner) some custom guns that no other game will have, plus some other stuff I can't remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is &quot;designed&quot; to be a casual shooter with hopefully few sweats. I sincerely hope the players find fun and have some laughs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are shooting for a full release in Q3 2026. Thank you for considering our game.         </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mags and Body Bags is a new, free-to-play, low-poly FPS, PVP shooter and the brain child of a 63 year old idiot who thought what would happen if someone who didn't know or care about the rules of making video games, actually made a video game. Mags and Body Bags is the result of that idiot trying to make a game........actually I didn't make it, I pay other talented people to make it. The game turned into a long-term family project, including help from my children, their spouses and my grand kids. So we have input from family members, young &amp; old.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mags and Body Bags has multiple launch maps, with squads, proximity chat, season pass, no pay to win, key rebinding, steam achievements, multiple modes, rag doll animations, 10 launch maps, customizable body bags (as a player banner) some custom guns that no other game will have, plus some other stuff I can't remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is &quot;designed&quot; to be a casual shooter with hopefully few sweats. I sincerely hope the players find fun and have some laughs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are shooting for a full release in Q3 2026. Thank you for considering our game.         </p>", "short_description": "Squad up, gear up, and blow up the scoreboard. Mags and Body Bags delivers a free-to-play, multi-mode FPS with deep customization and zero pay-to-win, for players on mouse and keyboard or controller.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735690/cc9266b06474fae7a39a401e35a38cc5d225da91/header.jpg?t=1788219270", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735690/70ce5a0e37a6a5aabf578afdb91266ab9ae515a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788219270", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735690/70ce5a0e37a6a5aabf578afdb91266ab9ae515a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788219270", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system OS: Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 6600K / Ryzen 3 1300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 580 / GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br><